received_works.body:
Hello, it's nice to meet you! I really like your artstyle and I was hoping you could draw my character ;v;
I would like the style where she has her nun's veil on. I will leave expressions and poses up to you! But please note that when she is in any kind of negative mood, the star on her forehead is purple and her star pupils are not visible, as you can see on the left side of the reference. But when she is happy, she has the expression and eyes that you can see in the small star-shaped cut-out, with a yellow moon and stars/sparkles in her eyes! Thank you very much, I really hope you consider my request!

https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rBWmLHxTLaA1Tq54II6FCS6OxUU9sfjG/view?usp=sharing
